messages.body_plain:
If I have:

  data{
    matrix[N,K] x ;
    vector[K] z ;
  }

I can do:

  transformed_data{
    vector[N] y ;
    y = x*z ;
  }

but what would I do if I have

  data{
    vector[N] y ;
    matrix[N,K] x ;
  }

and I want to figure out z (given the relationship y=x*z)

  transformed_data{
    vector[K] z ;
    z = ??? ;
  }

?

Thanks in advance!

Mike

